      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Video and audio assets\n\nRegister a **video** and an **audio clip** in your private asset library, list the library, and reference both by their `asset://` URIs in **Seedance 2.5 Reference** (inputs *asset_1* and *asset_2*).\n\nA sample clip and a sample voice line are generated so the template runs as it is. To use your own media, paste public https links into *video_url* / *audio_url*, or connect *Load Video* / *Load Audio* to the *video* / *audio* sockets (local uploads need a Comfy.org login).\n\nNeeds a ModelArk key, a Seed Speech key and IAM AK/SK with asset-library permission in Settings > BytePlus."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
